<title>USA: Ivex Packaging acquires Trio Products.</title>
<headline>Ivex Packaging acquires Trio Products.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivex Packaging Corp said Wednesday it acquired the business and assets of Trio Products Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Elyria, Ohio-based Trio is an extruder of recycled PET sheet, high-density polyethylene sheet and polypropylene sheet.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
